# Android Box (`android_box_mode`)

Physical box plugged into the factory screen (mini PC). Car off/on → box reboots → **auto play in background**. Do not require the Flutter UI.

## Must

- Owner = native only: `BootReceiver` → FGS `ACTION_PLAY_GREETING_DELAYED` + `ACTION_BOOT_RETRY_GREETING`. Flutter `_initPlayOnOpen` **skips** this mode.
- Copy `boot_greeting.mp3` to **device-protected** storage while the app is open (`HiCarPlugin`). Direct Boot cannot read credential prefs.
- Identify a new boot via `BOOT_COUNT` then kernel `boot_id` — **not** wall-clock (many boxes have no RTC; clock rewind would skip forever).
- Poll audio focus (warm ~2s, cold wait). Slow box → keep waiting / alarm retry 15s·40s·90s. Do not cancel the boot greeting.
- Boot-started FGS uses type `specialUse` (API 34+). Other modes keep `mediaPlayback`.
- One greeting per **boot session**. Do not mark complete if playback never actually started.

## Don't

- Treat Box like màn độ (no play-on-open, overlay is not the auto-play path).
- Start FGS `mediaPlayback` from `BOOT_COMPLETED` on API 35.
- Reuse a completed session across a real new boot.
